nation for Health&#x02014;Veterans Enhanced Treatment</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">RNN</td><td align="left" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Recurrent neural network</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">RoBERTa</td><td align="left" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Robustly optimized BERT approach</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">TRACIR</td><td align="left" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Trauma Care In a Rucksack</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">USC ICT</td><td align="left" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">University of Southern California Institute for Creative Technologies</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">XAI</td><td align="left" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Explainable Artificial Intelligence</td></tr></tbody></array></p></glossary><ref-list><title>References</title><ref id="B1-bioengineering-12-00519"><label>1.</label><element-citation publication-type="other"><person-group person-group-type="author">
